WEBVTT

00:01:51.050 --> 00:01:53.230
This is one
exciting game!

00:01:53.710 --> 00:01:56.370
Koshien Stadium
is going wild!

00:01:57.730 --> 00:02:01.180
The quarterfinals, 2nd game:
Sakiyama High vs. Kase High.

00:02:01.730 --> 00:02:04.980
After 11 innings,
we're tied at one all.

00:02:06.060 --> 00:02:09.880
Noyama will lead off.
The heart of the lineup.

00:02:10.410 --> 00:02:12.110
Hi's batting average
is better than 500.

00:02:46.430 --> 00:02:48.450
Hey, Kentaro!

00:02:49.450 --> 00:02:52.750
We're going to Mika's house.
Wanna come along?

00:02:56.790 --> 00:02:57.540
Not really.

00:02:58.450 --> 00:02:59.990
I don't wanna, okay?

00:03:02.450 --> 00:03:04.980
Forget him. If he doesn't
want to come, leave him.

00:03:05.790 --> 00:03:06.540
Let's go!

00:03:06.790 --> 00:03:07.850
This is fun!

00:03:08.450 --> 00:03:11.360
I got this really
yummy dessert at home.

00:03:11.790 --> 00:03:14.140
Let's get to my house
as fast as we can.

00:03:16.140 --> 00:03:18.360
Putting on a
''cool '' act, kid?

00:03:19.800 --> 00:03:22.140
''I don't wanna, okay?''

00:03:22.480 --> 00:03:23.880
Sooner or later, you're
gonna regret it!

00:03:25.140 --> 00:03:28.040
''How I wish
I had gone along! ''

00:03:28.480 --> 00:03:30.910
''Forgive me, Mika! ''

00:03:31.810 --> 00:03:32.770
Something like that!

00:03:32.810 --> 00:03:35.910
''I saw Kyoko's panties today. ''

00:03:36.480 --> 00:03:40.390
''I saw them hanging by
the window while I paid the rent. ''

00:03:41.490 --> 00:03:42.580
Hey! You haven't...

00:03:43.160 --> 00:03:44.010
What else?

00:03:44.160 --> 00:03:46.040
I knew it!
You got my diary!

00:03:47.160 --> 00:03:48.560
Your fault! You just
left it lying around!

00:03:50.500 --> 00:03:52.200
''it was a
lucky accident. ''

00:03:52.500 --> 00:03:54.960
''Tomorrow will be
another good day! ''

00:03:55.500 --> 00:03:58.660
''The pink lacy one with
roses is my favorite. ''

00:04:06.180 --> 00:04:07.290
What's all
the commotion?

00:04:08.180 --> 00:04:09.990
Miss Manager, help me!

00:04:11.520 --> 00:04:13.190
I didn't do nuthin'!

00:04:14.190 --> 00:04:16.360
Godai, act your age!

00:04:17.190 --> 00:04:18.890
You got me wrong.
Kentaro took my...

00:04:19.190 --> 00:04:20.020
Your what?

00:04:21.190 --> 00:04:22.800
Well...
It's my...

00:04:23.860 --> 00:04:25.120
This'll explain everything.

00:04:29.870 --> 00:04:31.960
What are you doing, Godai!?

00:04:46.890 --> 00:04:50.050
Damn kid! One of these days, I'm
gonna get him and his backpack!

00:04:55.560 --> 00:04:57.350
Mom! I'm going
to the pool!

00:04:57.560 --> 00:04:58.730
Kentaro!

00:04:58.910 --> 00:05:00.920
You still have
summer homework left!

00:05:01.230 --> 00:05:02.980
Quit it! I got
days to do that!

00:05:03.580 --> 00:05:04.800
What a lazy brat!

00:05:05.910 --> 00:05:06.830
Are you going out?

00:05:07.580 --> 00:05:10.040
- - See ya!
- - I'm going to pick up Ikuko.

00:05:44.940 --> 00:05:46.730
Weren't you
going to the pool?

00:05:47.610 --> 00:05:49.020
It's not like I have to go.

00:05:53.290 --> 00:05:54.520
So Ikuko's coming?

00:05:54.960 --> 00:05:55.860
You heard about that?

00:05:57.620 --> 00:06:00.250
Clock Hill Station

00:06:20.660 --> 00:06:22.580
Kentaro, you came
to meet me, too?

00:06:22.980 --> 00:06:24.040
Ikuko!

00:06:24.980 --> 00:06:27.100
Hello, Auntie!

00:06:40.000 --> 00:06:42.580
- - It's so dusty!
- - A rare sight!

00:06:43.000 --> 00:06:44.870
A midsummer day's clean?

00:06:45.350 --> 00:06:47.270
I'm tutoring
Ikuko here today.

00:06:47.350 --> 00:06:49.830
I hear she has a pile of
summer homework left to do.

00:06:52.020 --> 00:06:54.480
And so you attempt
to enhance your image.

00:06:56.360 --> 00:06:58.980
No peeping.
And no talking. Please.

00:06:59.360 --> 00:07:01.370
She's too easily
distracted as it is.

00:07:02.690 --> 00:07:03.680
Did you hear me?

00:07:04.360 --> 00:07:05.560
Godai.

00:07:06.690 --> 00:07:10.790
Should you leave illicit
magazines on the floor?

00:07:11.710 --> 00:07:13.190
I was just about
to put these away.

00:07:17.370 --> 00:07:18.460
It's decided, then.

00:07:19.710 --> 00:07:21.870
I will take them
into my care.

00:07:23.380 --> 00:07:25.930
As long as you don't return
them while the kid's here.

00:07:27.050 --> 00:07:29.270
What insight you have!

00:07:29.710 --> 00:07:31.830
I know how you work.

00:07:34.390 --> 00:07:35.710
I'm here, Big Brother!

00:07:35.730 --> 00:07:38.270
Ikuko, you're supposed
to knock first!

00:07:38.730 --> 00:07:39.920
Guess I got carried away.

00:07:41.390 --> 00:07:42.710
You're here so early...

00:07:43.730 --> 00:07:45.430
Mr. Yotsuya, you
made another hole!

00:07:46.410 --> 00:07:50.160
I was simply attempting to return
some of Godai's publications.

00:07:51.080 --> 00:07:52.300
He's lying!

00:07:52.740 --> 00:07:53.600
Mr. Yotsuya...

00:07:54.080 --> 00:07:56.620
Mamezo makes a
delicious natto set.

00:07:58.080 --> 00:07:58.790
All right.

00:07:59.410 --> 00:08:01.290
I-I'll buy you
dinner tomorrow.

00:08:02.080 --> 00:08:03.230
With an egg?

00:08:04.080 --> 00:08:05.110
Okay, right on the top.

00:08:05.420 --> 00:08:06.060
Done!

00:08:08.420 --> 00:08:10.600
Freshman Junior High Math Textbook 1-2
Ikuko Otonashi

00:08:11.770 --> 00:08:13.660
I'll leave
Ikuko with you.

00:08:15.100 --> 00:08:16.360
You can rely on me.

00:08:17.110 --> 00:08:18.680
Ikuko, study hard!

00:08:18.770 --> 00:08:19.350
Okay!

00:08:20.770 --> 00:08:22.770
At least it SOUNDS
like she wants to study.

00:08:28.440 --> 00:08:31.600
Your room is a lot
cleaner than I thought!

00:08:32.120 --> 00:08:33.640
Hey!
Don't open that!

00:08:33.790 --> 00:08:34.480
W-What's this?

00:08:34.790 --> 00:08:35.370
Hey!

00:08:36.450 --> 00:08:38.440
Didn't you go
to the pool?

00:08:40.790 --> 00:08:42.810
I thought maybe
I oughtta study, too.

00:08:43.460 --> 00:08:44.450
Then do it.

00:08:45.130 --> 00:08:46.730
What are you
doing here?

00:08:47.140 --> 00:08:50.540
Said he wants to study.
He must be feverish.

00:08:55.140 --> 00:08:56.910
Do you want to
study with Ikuko?

00:08:57.470 --> 00:08:58.350
T-That's not it!

00:08:58.470 --> 00:09:02.750
Now I get it! You're a
regular ladykiller already!

00:09:04.810 --> 00:09:05.870
I didn't say that!

00:09:07.480 --> 00:09:09.040
Maybe I can ask them.

00:09:10.480 --> 00:09:12.790
Don't bother.
That's not what I meant.

00:09:13.500 --> 00:09:14.150
But...

00:09:14.160 --> 00:09:14.940
Forget it!

00:09:16.160 --> 00:09:16.830
Are you sure?

00:09:18.160 --> 00:09:19.180
Then I won't!

00:09:29.500 --> 00:09:31.910
Have any other
girls been up here?

00:09:32.500 --> 00:09:34.290
Would you at least study
before you change the subject?

00:09:34.850 --> 00:09:36.450
Don't you have
a girlfriend?

00:09:36.850 --> 00:09:38.420
it doesn't matter.

00:09:39.180 --> 00:09:40.170
You don't, do you?

00:09:40.180 --> 00:09:43.000
Stop that. I was pretty
popular in high school.

00:09:43.520 --> 00:09:45.390
I even got some
love letters.

00:09:46.520 --> 00:09:48.540
And your first kiss
was back then?

00:09:49.850 --> 00:09:51.080
Let's see.
Oh yeah.

00:09:51.520 --> 00:09:53.140
I was a junior
in high school...

00:09:54.540 --> 00:09:55.620
Hey, are you
listening to me?

00:09:55.870 --> 00:09:56.470
Excuse me...

00:10:00.200 --> 00:10:03.300
Kentaro would like
to study with you.

00:10:04.540 --> 00:10:07.470
T-That's fine!
Kentaro, Soichiro, whoever.

00:10:18.550 --> 00:10:20.520
Okay then, study hard!

00:10:27.560 --> 00:10:28.960
You rat.

00:10:30.910 --> 00:10:33.020
Okay, let's study!

00:10:36.230 --> 00:10:37.100
Kentaro!

00:10:38.250 --> 00:10:40.050
What's the deal this time?

00:10:40.580 --> 00:10:41.870
N-Nothing!

00:10:41.910 --> 00:10:42.850
Kentaro!

00:10:44.250 --> 00:10:46.620
You're the strong,
quiet type, huh?

00:10:49.920 --> 00:10:51.440
Y-You think so?

00:10:58.600 --> 00:10:59.790
What's with him?

00:11:16.270 --> 00:11:18.270
Let's see...

00:11:18.620 --> 00:11:21.370
Look. The base
times the height.

00:11:21.950 --> 00:11:22.850
That's right!

00:11:24.290 --> 00:11:24.890
Working on yours?

00:11:27.950 --> 00:11:28.970
- - Let me see.
- - No!

00:11:30.620 --> 00:11:31.670
What's with you?

00:11:33.290 --> 00:11:36.540
Trying to be precocious?
Girls don't like that attitude.

00:11:37.640 --> 00:11:40.390
What's wrong?
You should let him have a look!

00:11:44.640 --> 00:11:46.950
You haven't done a thing!

00:11:47.640 --> 00:11:48.790
What's the
matter with you?

00:11:48.970 --> 00:11:51.430
Left your
brain at home?

00:11:55.310 --> 00:11:55.980
Excuse me...

00:11:57.320 --> 00:11:59.310
Godai, may l
have a moment?

00:12:00.660 --> 00:12:03.750
I'm going to get
something for dinner.

00:12:04.320 --> 00:12:06.100
Do you have any
preferences?

00:12:08.330 --> 00:12:11.580
I thought I'd cook you something
as thanks for tutoring Ikuko.

00:12:13.330 --> 00:12:15.580
Y-You're gonna
cook for me?

00:12:25.340 --> 00:12:26.330
I'm overwhelmed!

00:12:27.020 --> 00:12:28.590
Auntie, I'll come with you!

00:12:29.680 --> 00:12:31.140
What about your homework?

00:12:32.350 --> 00:12:33.960
We're almost done here anyway!

00:12:34.350 --> 00:12:37.640
All right. Then Kentaro,
why don't you come with us?

00:12:55.040 --> 00:12:56.710
Hurry up, Auntie!

00:12:57.040 --> 00:12:59.230
Hold on a second.
Where is Kentaro?

00:12:59.390 --> 00:13:00.580
He's waiting outside.

00:13:01.710 --> 00:13:05.200
I envy you kids. You can
join the girls anytime.

00:13:06.050 --> 00:13:08.160
If you wanna come,
why don'tcha just ask?

00:13:09.050 --> 00:13:12.040
It's not that simple.
An adult's life is complicated.

00:13:12.720 --> 00:13:14.770
You're just afraid
she won't let you come.

00:13:19.730 --> 00:13:22.890
You didn't tell
the manager anything, did you?

00:13:23.750 --> 00:13:25.700
- - ''Anything ''?
- - You know what I'm saying.

00:13:26.070 --> 00:13:28.000
You mean the part where
you saw the manager's panties.

00:13:30.070 --> 00:13:31.060
Well?

00:13:32.410 --> 00:13:33.230
I told her!

00:13:33.750 --> 00:13:34.830
You idiot!

00:13:35.080 --> 00:13:38.070
Damn! I gave you
500 yen for that!

00:13:38.750 --> 00:13:40.080
I was kidding!
I didn't tell her!

00:13:40.080 --> 00:13:41.220
- - Liar!
- - Believe me!

00:13:41.750 --> 00:13:42.980
- - You told her, didn't you?
- - I didn't!

00:13:43.090 --> 00:13:43.820
Ouch! Ouch!

00:13:44.770 --> 00:13:45.790
What's the matter
with you?

00:13:46.090 --> 00:13:47.770
L-Leave me alone
Soichiro!

00:13:48.090 --> 00:13:49.520
- - That's how it was.
- - Stop it!

00:13:50.430 --> 00:13:51.980
Soichiro! Stop that!

00:13:52.100 --> 00:13:54.540
Hey! Let go!
Let go of me!

00:13:55.430 --> 00:13:58.040
What are you three
boys doing there?

00:14:03.120 --> 00:14:04.540
T-Three boys...

00:14:07.120 --> 00:14:09.100
Manager, let's just leave!

00:14:09.790 --> 00:14:10.750
Okay.

00:14:10.790 --> 00:14:12.680
Isn't Big Brother coming, too?

00:14:13.120 --> 00:14:14.930
Grocery shopping
would only bore Godai.

00:14:15.790 --> 00:14:16.500
Right?

00:14:19.120 --> 00:14:19.970
I...

00:14:20.460 --> 00:14:22.100
l do have several chores...

00:14:44.820 --> 00:14:47.640
If you wanted to come, why
didn't you just say so?

00:14:49.160 --> 00:14:52.870
It's the adult world.
You wouldn't understand.

00:14:55.500 --> 00:14:56.200
Godai.

00:14:57.500 --> 00:14:59.640
Do you have any
requests for dinner?

00:14:59.830 --> 00:15:02.790
- - Well l...
- - How about you-know-what?

00:15:03.500 --> 00:15:05.750
That one? I wonder if
Godai would like it?

00:15:06.170 --> 00:15:07.840
He will.
It's really good!

00:15:08.520 --> 00:15:10.770
I'd eat
anything you cook!

00:15:11.180 --> 00:15:15.050
Pig slop, cow cud.
I'll eat anything you cook!

00:15:15.850 --> 00:15:17.550
Is that supposed
to be a compliment?

00:15:21.520 --> 00:15:22.980
What's it gonna be?

00:15:29.200 --> 00:15:30.250
Let's check it out!

00:15:32.200 --> 00:15:35.220
I'll have 500 grams each
of sirloin and liver.

00:15:35.870 --> 00:15:37.250
Coming right up.

00:15:39.200 --> 00:15:41.100
I'll need
leeks and garlic...

00:15:42.210 --> 00:15:43.500
And eggs!

00:15:43.540 --> 00:15:45.540
it sounds like a
frightening menu!

00:15:47.210 --> 00:15:49.050
This is fun!

00:15:50.210 --> 00:15:52.730
I've missed cooking for
someone special.

00:15:54.890 --> 00:15:57.890
S-S-Someone special.

00:16:06.230 --> 00:16:07.410
- - Go to the right!
- - R-Right?

00:16:07.570 --> 00:16:08.750
Push the button!

00:16:11.250 --> 00:16:11.910
Watch out!

00:16:18.580 --> 00:16:19.870
It's your turn,
Kentaro!

00:16:31.920 --> 00:16:34.290
Wow! You're good,
Kentaro!

00:16:34.930 --> 00:16:36.600
I've played it a couple of
times at a friend's house.

00:16:46.600 --> 00:16:48.750
You're great!

00:16:58.290 --> 00:17:01.500
Those two seem very
happy all of a sudden.

00:17:21.310 --> 00:17:23.500
Godai, dinner
will be ready soon.

00:17:25.640 --> 00:17:27.660
I put in eggs already...

00:17:28.310 --> 00:17:30.620
...and leeks... leeks
and liver... liver!

00:17:31.320 --> 00:17:32.340
She's so enthusiastic.

00:17:35.650 --> 00:17:37.180
Is there any way I can help?

00:17:38.000 --> 00:17:40.750
No, you just sit. I'm
the one waiting on you.

00:17:51.000 --> 00:17:52.810
Kyoko, is there
any way I can help?

00:17:53.680 --> 00:17:56.040
No, Soichiro!
Just have a seat.

00:17:59.680 --> 00:18:00.500
What's so funny?

00:18:00.680 --> 00:18:02.210
It's nothing!

00:18:09.700 --> 00:18:11.180
How did the homework go?

00:18:13.020 --> 00:18:15.960
Ikuko did well.
Kentaro didn't do much.

00:18:20.040 --> 00:18:22.370
Kentaro seems
to like Ikuko.

00:18:28.040 --> 00:18:29.620
So that's it.

00:18:32.710 --> 00:18:37.730
Boys that age do seem to
get interested in older girls.

00:18:43.730 --> 00:18:45.620
It's the same for
boys of any age.

00:18:47.730 --> 00:18:48.700
Are you all right?

00:18:49.060 --> 00:18:50.210
I'm okay.

00:18:50.400 --> 00:18:52.070
But it's bleeding!

00:18:54.400 --> 00:18:56.270
What you said, it...

00:19:00.750 --> 00:19:01.710
But it is the same.

00:19:14.750 --> 00:19:16.710
I'm so hungry!
Is dinner ready yet?

00:19:18.090 --> 00:19:19.110
What's going on?

00:19:19.430 --> 00:19:21.000
N-Nothing!

00:19:32.450 --> 00:19:33.500
Bon appetit!

00:19:35.450 --> 00:19:36.400
It's delicious!

00:19:37.110 --> 00:19:37.930
That's good.

00:19:39.110 --> 00:19:41.860
It's delicious
really good!

00:19:42.460 --> 00:19:44.410
I told you.
Auntie's a good cook!

00:19:44.790 --> 00:19:47.060
I'm flattered! Eat as
much as you like!

00:19:49.800 --> 00:19:53.200
I will! You cooked all
of this just for me.

00:19:56.800 --> 00:19:59.660
It's delicious, Kyoko!
It's excellent!

00:20:01.480 --> 00:20:06.260
If I please you, I'd be happy
to cook for you every day!

00:20:07.810 --> 00:20:09.180
T-That means...

00:20:15.810 --> 00:20:19.090
l may not be good enough, but
please accept me as your wife.

00:20:20.150 --> 00:20:21.820
K-Kyoko!

00:20:29.840 --> 00:20:30.910
Is anything wrong?

00:20:33.160 --> 00:20:36.480
I was thinking how nice it'd
be to eat like this every day.

00:20:37.170 --> 00:20:40.420
Godai said the exact same
thing as Uncle Soichiro!

00:20:41.170 --> 00:20:43.730
This was my uncle's
favorite dish!

00:20:45.520 --> 00:20:48.450
Auntie? Were you thinking
about Uncle Soichiro?

00:20:49.180 --> 00:20:50.770
Y-Yes, a little!

00:20:54.850 --> 00:20:57.760
But I'm so happy that
Godai likes it, too.

00:20:58.520 --> 00:20:59.660
Please have some more!

00:21:03.860 --> 00:21:07.170
I'd sure like to cook
like this for my boyfriend!

00:21:09.210 --> 00:21:10.000
Boyfriend?

00:21:10.540 --> 00:21:14.480
Well, not yet, but I like
this hunk in the soccer club.

00:21:14.870 --> 00:21:15.750
He's two years
older than me.

00:21:30.890 --> 00:21:31.950
See ya!
Big Brother, Kentaro!

00:21:32.230 --> 00:21:33.720
- - Come and visit us again!
- - I will!

00:21:34.890 --> 00:21:37.060
Kentaro, come to my house
next time.

00:21:39.230 --> 00:21:40.500
It's getting late.

00:21:41.900 --> 00:21:43.270
See you later!
Bye bye!

00:21:43.900 --> 00:21:45.480
Be careful on
your way home.

00:22:11.270 --> 00:22:12.050
Shall we go?

00:22:20.270 --> 00:22:21.480
I'll treat you to a juice!

00:22:22.950 --> 00:22:24.170
I'll let you treat
me to a juice!

00:22:39.300 --> 00:22:40.050
Kentaro.

00:22:42.630 --> 00:22:46.590
There are quite a few
hard times in a man's life.

00:22:50.630 --> 00:22:54.880
But no matter what, don't
give up on your dream.

00:23:02.310 --> 00:23:05.150
We're kind of alike.

00:23:08.320 --> 00:23:10.760
You idiot! We're nothing alike!

00:23:12.000 --> 00:23:14.720
I'll never be
anything like you!

00:23:19.010 --> 00:23:20.500
Y-You brat!

00:23:20.660 --> 00:23:21.480
Wait up!

00:23:24.670 --> 00:23:26.290
You can never
make up your mind!

00:23:26.670 --> 00:23:27.760
You jerk!

00:23:28.020 --> 00:23:31.800
I'm gonna tell Ikuko how long
you were wetting your bed!

00:23:32.340 --> 00:23:33.420
No, don't do it!

00:23:33.680 --> 00:23:34.680
You deserve it!

00:23:34.680 --> 00:23:36.300
I'm gonna tell
Ikuko for sure!

00:23:36.680 --> 00:23:37.880
Remember the panties!

00:23:50.710 --> 00:23:52.200
Yes, so I am a widow...

00:23:52.710 --> 00:23:55.520
...and I don't want to forget
about Soichiro, but still...!

00:23:56.040 --> 00:23:57.870
I can't believe Godai
went out on a date!

00:23:58.050 --> 00:24:01.110
Next: ''One Entangled Evening!
I Thought You Said You Loved Me?''

00:24:01.720 --> 00:24:05.500
I'm not jealous, but
then why do I get so angry?
